 Ticket prices for the Lantern community cinema. `data/screenings.json` lists this month's screenings. Matinees (starting before 17:00) are £7.50 and evening screenings £10.00.
 
+Club members get 20% off and concessions (students, over-65s, carers) get £2 off. The two don't stack: a member who is also a concession pays whichever price is lower for them.
+
 ## Usage
 
 ```
